{"t":"Turtle","s":"turtle-06deb","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Turtle_40be0c.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Turtle</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Turtle\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Turtle_40be0c.gif\" width=\"96\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a><br/>Animals</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff3300; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150604152621&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Turtle_40be0c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a turtle.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The shores of <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Laguna%20Islands\">Laguna Islands</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\nThey seem to be  treated as pets by mermaids, and can be used for transportation between islands that do not have normal seaports. Simply stepping onto a sea turtle will cause it to transport you to a nearby island, but only if you have permission to use them. Sea turtle transports are protection zones. Throwing lootbags on the turtle won't work, you will have to use the royal mailbox on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Laguna%20Islands\">Laguna Islands</a> instead.<br/><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Seaturtle\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"132\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Seaturtle_b6dab8.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure><br/>After having travelled on the back of one of these turtles 2000 times, you will receive the achievement Quick as a Turtle.\n    </div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Charles\">Charles</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Crystal%20Teleport%20System\">Gnomish Crystal Teleport System</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a></li><li>Navigation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nordic%20Tibia%20Ferries\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</a></li><li>Port Hope Ferries</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li><li>Travelling</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":[]}